          href="https://iptvnator.vercel.app"
          class="text-accent-400 underline decoration-accent-500/30 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-accent-300 hover:decoration-accent-400/50"
        >
          iptvnator.vercel.app
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
