1. If there is at least 1 post, show the first post as a featured card (same `FeaturedBlogPost` component)
2. Show the remaining 2 posts in a 2-column grid below
3. Import `FeaturedBlogPost` at the top
4. Split: `const [featuredPost, ...otherPosts] = posts;`

Updated blog section:
```astro
{featuredPost && (
  <FeaturedBlogPost
    title={featuredPost.data.title}
    description={featuredPost.data.description}
    pubDate={featuredPost.data.pubDate}
